          "page": 28,
          "text": "CPU Memory Hierarchy\n\nReducing Penalty: Multi-Level Cache\n\n\n 1 clk          10 clks         20 clks          300 clks                       Second            Third\n           First-level                                                           Main                            Level            Level\n        Cache                                                    Memory                       Cache         Cache\n                                                    (DRAM)\n          L1             L2             L3\n\n                        On-die\n\n Average Memory Access Time (AMAT)\n = Thit(L1) + Miss%(L1)* (Thit(L2)\n + Miss%(L2)* (Thit(L3) + Miss%(L3)*T(memory) ) )\n\n AMAT = ?\n    2.115 (compare to 31 with no multi-levels)\n    14.7x Speed Up\n\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory    GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        28",
